<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background: #f8fafc;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: white;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      }
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #3b82f6 100%);
        color: white;
        padding: 28px 24px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .header h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 28px 24px;
        color: #334155;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .otp-box {
        background: #f1f5f9;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 24px 0;
        border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .otp-code {
        font-size: 38px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #1e40af;
        letter-spacing: 6px;
        font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        margin: 12px 0;
        background: white;
        padding: 14px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border: 2px dashed #93c5fd;
        display: inline-block;
      }
      .warning-box {
        background: #fef3c7;
        border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
        padding: 14px 18px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        color: #92400e;
        font-size: 13px;
      }
      .footer {
        background: #f8fafc;
        padding: 18px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #64748b;
        border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h2>📦 Delivery Verification Code</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p>Hello <strong><%= @buyer_name %></strong>,</p>

        <p>Your order <strong><%= @order_ref %></strong> is out for delivery. Please share the OTP below with your delivery executive only after receiving and inspecting the package.</p>

        <div class="otp-box">
          <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #64748b; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600;">Delivery Verification OTP</p>
          <div class="otp-code"><%= @otp %></div>
          <p style="margin: 8px 0 0 0; color: #64748b; font-size: 13px;">Share this code with the delivery person to confirm receipt.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="warning-box">
          <strong>Important Instructions:</strong>
          <ul style="margin: 6px 0 0 0; padding-left: 18px;">
            <li>Do not share this OTP before checking the physical condition of the package.</li>
            <li>Once verified with this OTP, your order will be marked as successfully delivered.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>SalesPoints E-Commerce • Automated System Notification</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
